  "builtInResources": [
    {
      "uri": "convertigo://capabilities",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "text": "# Convertigo MCP capabilities\\n\\n- Project discovery: `project-list`, `databaseobject-tree-get`.\\n- Authoring: `palette-list`, `palette-describe`, `databaseobject-tree-apply`, `databaseobject-rename`, `databaseobject-move`, `databaseobject-delete`.\\n- Bulk orchestration: `batch-call`.\\n- Diagnostics: `log-view`, `requestable-execute`.\\n- Marketplace: `marketplace-list`, `marketplace-import`."
    },
    {
      "uri": "convertigo://recipes/quickstart",
      "mimeType": "text/markdown",
      "text": "# Quickstart recipes\\n\\n1. Discover parent capabilities with `palette-list` then `palette-describe`.\\n2. Create or patch one-shot trees with `databaseobject-tree-apply` (`at=inside|before|after|self`).\\n3. Use `mode=merge|replace` in `databaseobject-tree-apply` for incremental vs strict patching.\\n4. Navigate large trees with `databaseobject-tree-get` (`childrenDepth`, `properties`, `_nextCursor`).\\n5. Orchestrate macro changes with `batch-call` and `$ref`."
    }
  ]
